# Files that Docker does not send to the build. The images install their own dependencies and build their own output.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local environment files can contain secrets. Keep the example files, because the images read them.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Files that the images do not need.
**/*.md
.git
.vscode
.idea
